OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some late brightness.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will remain
OL,8,Fdry with clear periods. Chilly in some
OL,9,Fsheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,12,Freach the southwest in the morning,
OL,13,Fspreading to Edinburgh, Lothian and
OL,14,FBorders in the afternoon. Fresh
OL,15,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry and
OL,18,Fbright on Friday. Windy with rain
OL,19,Fspreading east on Saturday. Drier and
OL,20,Fbrighter on Sunday with a few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
